        "event_id": "lite_evt_00164",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete postoperative monitoring plan with escalation triggers.",
        "quote": "突然大量鲜血、或者变脓变绿变臭"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00223",
        "explanation": "The final visible event was still an unanswered family confirmation question, so the episode was not cleanly closed.",
        "quote": "今晚是不是就按护士说的"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The prior plans were mostly safe and executable, but the observable trajectory ended after a family question without a final doctor response, and one preceding doctor response was truncated. This makes the bounded ending an imperfect open state rather than a valid closed loop.",
