          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a structured escalation framework that the caregiver later acknowledged.",
          "quote": "三级判断，照着这个办"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The trajectory obtained practical caregiver receipt of the red-flag plan and unresolved boundaries, even though the final terminal message remained unanswered.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
